= Summary
<summary>
This is a template for a presentation following the
#link("https://www.tudelft.nl/en/tu-delft-corporate-design")[TU Delft corporate design]
using Typst polylux. It used the font family
#link("https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Roboto+Slab")[Roboto Slab] and
#link("https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arial")[Arial] or alternatively the
Typst default font
#link("https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Libertinus")[Libertinus Serif].

The template is made by the same authors as the
#link("https://www.overleaf.com/edu/tudelft#templates")[TU Delft presentation template found on Overleaf].
The repository of the developers is https:/\/gitlab.com/novanext

#link("docs/presentation.pdf")[The template itself] gives a more
thorough overview of the functionality
